@host = http://localhost:5052
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as the seeded customer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@support.local",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### List tickets after copying accessToken above
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
